  "description": "3-Bedroom Apartment, Enniscrone – Short-Term Let October to May\n\nBeautiful 3-bedroom apartment in the heart of Enniscrone, just a short walk from the stunning Enniscrone beach and all local amenities.\n\nThe apartment offers comfortable accommodation with 3 bedrooms, a spacious living area, fully equipped kitchen, bathroom and parking.\n\nEnniscrone is a wonderful seaside location with its famous sandy beach, surf school, golf course, restaurants, cafés and pubs. Ballina is approximately 15 minutes away and Sligo approximately 30 minutes by car.\n\nAvailable from October 2026 until the end of May 2027.\nShort-term let only – not available for a full-year tenancy.\n\nIdeal for anyone looking for a temporary home by the coast.\n\nPlease contact me for further details or to arrange a viewing.",
